@host = http://localhost:8000
@org = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@kb = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Readiness
GET {{host}}/ready

### Upload a document
POST {{host}}/v1/documents
X-Organization-Id: {{org}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="knowledge_base_id"

{{kb}}
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="refund-policy.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ./examples/corpus/refund-policy.md
--WebAppBoundary--

### List documents
GET {{host}}/v1/documents?knowledge_base_id={{kb}}
X-Organization-Id: {{org}}

### Ask a question
POST {{host}}/v1/chat
X-Organization-Id: {{org}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "knowledge_base_id": "{{kb}}",
  "question": "How many days do customers have to return most items?"
}

### Start an evaluation
POST {{host}}/v1/evaluations
X-Organization-Id: {{org}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "knowledge_base_id": "{{kb}}"
}

### Extract facts from an indexed document
POST {{host}}/v1/extract
X-Organization-Id: {{org}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "knowledge_base_id": "{{kb}}",
  "document_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003"
}
